# WP3.5 D031 locked-audio fixture through the real D029 panel editor.
# Button ids: SEQ=11. Encoder ids: KNOB1=2 KNOB2=3 KNOB3=4.
# Physical white key index 7 = local/global row 5 UI (zero-based step 4).
# Physical white key index 9 = local/global row 6 UI (zero-based step 5).

50 btn 11

# Row 5: VOICE 255 -> 128, FINE 128 -> 192, TRACK 255 -> 128.
100 keys 128
120 enc 2 -127
120 enc 3 64
120 enc 4 -127
140 keys 0

# Row 6 is EMPTY in the proof pattern. Mute it with row-local VOICE=0.
160 keys 512
180 enc 2 -255
200 keys 0

# Row 7 remains unlocked and must restore defaults while the note stays active.
1200 end
